            "notes": "If you're NOT facing a team with group cleanses, like [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) bubble, [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f) suzu, or [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed) with [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f), then don't bother taking [Furnace Fuel](item_aac67acc-e7d0-4465-b3d3-1276a6de0f86) this or in any other round, replace it with some optional items instead. \n\n[Silver Spurs](item_8d812772-e37d-4af2-ade8-6a43d6e64a4c) is a great item. The extra move speed for escape is really nice to have, especially in stadium's fast-paced mode.",
