            "notes": "[Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) lets you re-apply burns to targets that have been cleansed, and also helps you if someone you want to damage didn't get hit using your abilities. I take this even if the other team doesn't have cleanses, as I just really like the usefulness of it.\n\n[Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) lets you deal more damage to targets even without WP - assuming they're burning, at least, which they probably often will be with your build.\n\nIronically, if the enemy team has heroes with a bunch of negative effects, especially [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or an AP [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), then you might want to consider taking [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) to lessen the effects.",
