            "created_at": "2025-08-29T02:16:28.17273+00:00",
            "notes": "If you have enough, getting [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is really nice for the lifesteal and AP/WP, but don't sacrifice too much for it if you can't afford it yet.\n\n### More Options:\nAround here is where you can get certain epic items depending on what you need for your game. Usually, I don't tend to get [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) until round 6-7, but they can be really good to take against certain team comps, and doubly so if the enemy doesn't have the ability to cleanse your burns. Against a [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), for example, taking [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) might be a good idea to stop some of her lifesteal, and picking [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) could help slow enemies trying to run it into your team, making it easier to pick them off.",
