            "notes": "[Double Barrelled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) allows for even more flexibility/ability to apply burns.\n\nAdding in [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) for some burst damage and [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for power and lifesteal. \n\nAround here is where I'd probably get rid of [Furnace Fuel](item_aac67acc-e7d0-4465-b3d3-1276a6de0f86), but if there's a bunch of cleanses going around and you think it's worth it, then you can keep it.",
